# Byte-stable data artifacts.
#
# Several datasets carry recorded SHA-256 digests in their metadata.json. Those
# digests are computed over LF bytes, so the working tree must not be converted
# to CRLF on checkout (core.autocrlf=true would otherwise break the digest and
# the reproducibility tests that verify it).
data/**/*.jsonl text eol=lf
data/**/*.json text eol=lf
data/**/*.parquet -text
